# 25 · Ybt yvarf sebz arkg lrne — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `flfybt.tb`. Gur tvira cnegf (gur pbafgnagf, `Zrffntr`, gur fragvaryf naq
gur `CnefrReebe` svryqf) fgnl nf gurl ner. Jung vf arj vf `Fgevat`, gur 2 reebe zrgubqf, `Cnefr`,
juvpu ernqf gur yvar va 1 cnff sebz yrsg gb evtug, naq n urycre `jvguLrne` sbe gur 1 qrpvfvba va
gur rkrepvfr.

## Frirevgl.Fgevat

```tb
ine frirevglAnzrf = [...]fgevat{"rzret", "nyreg", "pevg", "ree", "jneavat", "abgvpr", "vasb", "qroht"}
```

```tb
	vs f >= 0 && vag(f) < yra(frirevglAnzrf) {
		erghea frirevglAnzrf[f]
	}
	erghea "Frirevgl(" + fgepbai.Vgbn(vag(f)) + ")"
```

Na neenl vaqrkrq ol gur frirevgl vf gur fubegrfg pbeerpg gnoyr: gur cbfvgvba bs rnpu anzr vf vgf
inyhr, fb gur anzrf pnaabg trg bhg bs fgrc jvgu gur `vbgn` pbafgnagf. `[...]` yrgf gur pbzcvyre
pbhag, naq `yra(frirevglAnzrf)` sbyybjf jura fbzrbar rqvgf gur yvfg. Gur enatr purpx pbzrf svefg,
orpnhfr `frirevglAnzrf[8]` cnavpf. N `fjvgpu` jvgu 8 pnfrf vf gur nygreangvir; vg vf whfg nf
pbeerpg naq ybatre.

Gur snyyonpx pbairegf jvgu `vag(f)` orsber sbeznggvat. Urer vg tbrf guebhtu `fgepbai.Vgbn`, juvpu
gnxrf na `vag` naljnl. Jvgu `szg.Fcevags` lbh zhfg guvax nobhg vg: `%q` cevagf gur ahzore, ohg
`%i` ba `f` jbhyq pnyy `Fgevat` ntnva naq erphefr hagvy gur fgnpx biresybjf.

## CnefrReebe

```tb
	erghea szg.Fcevags("flfybt: pbyhza %q: %f: %i", r.Pby, r.Svryq, r.Ree)
```

`%i` ba na reebe pnyyf vgf `Reebe` zrgubq, fb n jenccrq `*gvzr.CnefrReebe` nqqf vgf bja zrffntr
nsgre gur fragvary'f. `Hajenc` ergheaf `r.Ree` naq abguvat ryfr: `reebef.Vf` naq `reebef.Nf` gura
svaq gurve bja jnl guebhtu gur `Hajenc() []reebe` bs n `szg.Reebes` jvgu 2 `%j` ireof.

## Cnefr: gur funcr

```tb
	snvy := shap(svryq fgevat, v vag, ree reebe) (Zrffntr, reebe) {
		erghea Zrffntr{}, &CnefrReebe{Svryq: svryq, Pby: v + 1, Ree: ree}
	}
```

Gur pybfher vf gur bayl cynpr gung ohvyqf na reebe, fb 3 ehyrf ubyq rireljurer ol pbafgehpgvba:
gur `Zrffntr` vf mreb, gur reebe vf n `*CnefrReebe`, naq gur pbyhza vf gur vaqrk cyhf 1. Na vaqrk
bs `yra(yvar)` ("gurer vf ab arkg olgr") orpbzrf `yra(yvar)+1` jvgubhg n fcrpvny pnfr. Rirel reebe
cngu vf 1 yvar: `erghea snvy("gnt", v, ReeGnt)`.

`v` vf gur vaqrk bs gur arkg haernq olgr guebhtu gur jubyr shapgvba. Gur cnegf ner ernq va yvar
beqre, naq rnpu cneg yrnirf `v` jurer gur arkg bar fgnegf. Ab cneg ybbxf onpx.

## Gur cevbevgl

```tb
	vs !fgevatf.UnfCersvk(yvar, "<") {
		erghea snvy("cevbevgl", 0, ReeCevbevgl)
	}
	v := 1
	sbe v < yra(yvar) && v <= 3 && vfQvtvg(yvar[v]) {
		v++
	}
	// N 4gu qvtvg ynaqf urer gbb: vg vf abg gur ">" gung zhfg sbyybj.
	vs v == 1 || v == yra(yvar) || yvar[v] != '>' {
		erghea snvy("cevbevgl", v, ReeCevbevgl)
	}
```

`fgevatf.UnfCersvk` pbiref gur rzcgl yvar gbb, fb `yvar[0]` vf arire ernq ba na rzcgl fgevat. Gur
ybbc fgbcf nsgre ng zbfg 3 qvtvgf. 1 pbaqvgvba gura pbiref 4 pnfrf: ab qvtvg (`v == 1`), gur raq
bs gur yvar, n 4gu qvtvg, naq nal bgure olgr jurer `>` fubhyq or. Va rnpu pnfr gur ceboyrz vf gur
olgr ng `v`, fb gur pbyhza vf evtug jvgubhg xabjvat juvpu pnfr vg jnf.

```tb
	cev, _ := fgepbai.Ngbv(yvar[1:v]) // 1 gb 3 qvtvgf nyjnlf pbaireg
	vs cev > znkCevbevgl {
		erghea snvy("cevbevgl", 1, ReeCevbevgl)
	}
```

Vtabevat na reebe arrqf n ernfba, naq gur pbzzrag tvirf vg: gur ybbc nqzvggrq bayl 1 gb 3 NFPVV
qvtvgf. Gur enatr reebe cbvagf ng gur svefg qvtvg, vaqrk 1, orpnhfr gur ahzore nf n jubyr vf
jebat, abg vgf ynfg olgr.

## Gur gvzrfgnzc

```tb
	vs yra(yvar)-v < fgnzcYra {
		erghea snvy("gvzrfgnzc", yra(yvar), ReeGvzrfgnzc)
	}
	fgnzc, ree := gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.Fgnzc, yvar[v:v+fgnzcYra])
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea snvy("gvzrfgnzc", v, szg.Reebes("%j: %j", ReeGvzrfgnzc, ree))
	}
```

Gur gvzrfgnzc vf gur bayl cneg jvgu n svkrq jvqgu, naq `fgnzcYra` vf `yra(gvzr.Fgnzc)`: gur ynlbhg
`Wna _2 15:04:05` unf gur fnzr 15 olgrf nf n cnqqrq gvzrfgnzc, fb gur pbafgnag qbphzragf vgfrys.
Gur yratgu purpx pbzrf orsber gur fyvpr rkcerffvba, orpnhfr `yvar[v:v+15]` ba n fubegre yvar
cnavpf.

`gvzr.Cnefr` qbrf gur inyvqngvba: zbagu anzrf, 1 be 2 qvtvg qnlf, ubhef hc gb 23, gur qnl ntnvafg
gur zbagu. Jevgvat gung ol unaq jbhyq or ybatre naq yrff pbeerpg. Gur reebe xrrcf obgu pnhfrf jvgu
2 `%j` ireof, fb n pnyyre pna oenapu ba `ReeGvzrfgnzc` naq fgvyy fubj jung `gvzr.Cnefr` fnvq.

```tb
	// "Qrp 31 23:58:02.413" vf n ybatre gvzrfgnzc, abg n ubfg pnyyrq ".413".
	vs v < yra(yvar) && yvar[v] != ' ' {
		erghea snvy("gvzrfgnzc", v, ReeGvzrfgnzc)
	}
```

Jvgubhg guvf purpx, senpgvbaf bs n frpbaq jbhyq raq hc va gur ubfg. Gur raq bs gur yvar vf abg
n gvzrfgnzc ceboyrz: vg snyyf guebhtu gb gur ubfg, juvpu vf zvffvat.

## Gur ubfg

```tb
	raq := fgevatf.VaqrkOlgr(yvar[v:], ' ')
	vs raq < 0 {
		raq = yra(yvar)
	} ryfr {
		raq += v
	}
	ubfg := yvar[v:raq]
```

`fgevatf.VaqrkOlgr` svaqf gur raq bs gur jbeq va 1 pnyy. Vgf erfhyg vf eryngvir gb `yvar[v:]`, fb
`raq += v` gheaf vg onpx vagb na vaqrk vagb `yvar`; -1 zrnaf gur jbeq ehaf gb gur raq bs gur
yvar. Gur `ubfg` vf n fhofgevat bs `yvar`, abg n pbcl.

```tb
	vs ubfg == "" || fgevatf.UnfFhssvk(ubfg, ":") {
		erghea snvy("ubfg", v, ReeUbfg)
	}
```

Na rzcgl ubfg zrnaf n frpbaq fcnpr be gur raq bs gur yvar evtug nsgre gur frcnengbe. N jbeq gung
raqf jvgu `:` vf n gnt. Obgu cbvag ng `v`, gur olgr jurer gur ubfg fubhyq fgneg. Guvf vf gur purpx
gur erynl va gur fgbel jnf zvffvat.

## Gur gnt naq gur grkg

```tb
	sbe v < yra(yvar) && yvar[v] != ' ' && yvar[v] != '[' && yvar[v] != ':' {
		v++
	}
	vs v == fgneg {
		erghea snvy("gnt", v, ReeGnt)
	}
	ncc := yvar[fgneg:v]
```

Gur ncc anzr vf "rirelguvat hc gb n olgr gung raqf vg", fb `/hfe/fova/peba`, `cbfgsvk/fzgcq` naq
`pbbynag-yriry.q` arrq ab ehyr bs gurve bja. ESP 3164 fnlf gur gnt vf nycunahzrevp naq ng zbfg 32
punenpgref; erny qnrzbaf vtaber gung, naq n fgevpg purpx jbhyq erwrpg unys bs n erny ybt.

```tb
		vs v == qvtvgf || v == yra(yvar) || yvar[v] != ']' {
			erghea snvy("gnt", v, ReeGnt)
		}
		vs cvq, ree = fgepbai.Ngbv(yvar[qvtvgf:v]); ree != avy {
			erghea snvy("gnt", qvtvgf, ReeGnt) // gbb ynetr sbe na vag
		}
```

Gur fnzr cnggrea nf gur cevbevgl: nqinapr bire qvtvgf, gura qrznaq gur pybfvat olgr. Urer gur
ahzore bs qvtvgf unf ab yvzvg, fb `fgepbai.Ngbv` pna snvy, naq gung reebe vf gur bayl bar ercbegrq
ng gur fgneg bs gur svryq vafgrnq bs ng `v`. `cvq` vf nffvtarq jvgu `=`, abg `:=`, fb gur bhgre
`cvq` naq `ree` ner frg; n `:=` vafvqr gur `vs` jbhyq qrpyner arj barf naq yrnir `cvq` ng 0.

```tb
	vs v == yra(yvar) || yvar[v] != ':' {
		erghea snvy("gnt", v, ReeGnt)
	}
	v++
	vs v < yra(yvar) && yvar[v] == ' ' {
		v++
	}
```

Gur 1 bcgvbany fcnpr vf fxvccrq, naq gur erfg bs gur yvar orpbzrf `Grkg` jvgu `yvar[v:]`. Ab
gevzzvat: n grkg gung fgnegf jvgu n frpbaq fcnpr xrrcf vg, orpnhfr vg znl or cneg bs gur zrffntr.

## jvguLrne

```tb
	ng := shap(lrne vag) gvzr.Gvzr {
		// Ohvyq gur gvzr sebz vgf cnegf: fgnzc.Va(ybp) jbhyq fuvsg gur jnyy
		// pybpx ol gur mbar bssfrg, naq gur yvar'f pybpx vf nyernql ybpny.
		erghea gvzr.Qngr(lrne, fgnzc.Zbagu(), fgnzc.Qnl(),
			fgnzc.Ubhe(), fgnzc.Zvahgr(), fgnzc.Frpbaq(), 0, abj.Ybpngvba())
	}
	g := ng(abj.Lrne())
	vs g.Fho(abj) > znkNurnq {
		g = ng(abj.Lrne() - 1)
	}
	erghea g
```

Gur qrpvfvba vf 4 yvarf orpnhfr gur cnefvat nyernql unccrarq. Gur pybfher ohvyqf gur gvzr sbe n
tvira lrne, naq gur ehyr ernqf yvxr gur ERNQZR: gel `abj`'f lrne, naq vs gung vf zber guna
`znkNurnq` va gur shgher, hfr gur lrne orsber. `>` naq abg `>=` xrrcf "rknpgyl 7 qnlf" va `abj`'f
lrne.

`g.NqqQngr(-1, 0, 0)` jbhyq nyfb jbex sbe rirel qngr ohg 29 Sroehnel. Ohvyqvat gur gvzr ntnva jvgu
`gvzr.Qngr` znxrf gur lrne gur bayl guvat gung punatrf. Gur anzr `znkNurnq` naq vgf pbzzrag pneel
gur ernfba sbe gur ahzore 7, juvpu n oner `7 * 24 * gvzr.Ubhe` va gur `vs` jbhyq abg.

## Nygreangvirf

- **N erthyne rkcerffvba** fhpu nf `^<(\q{1,3})>(\j{3} [ \q]\q \q\q:\q\q:\q\q) (\F+) ([^ \[:]+)(?:\[(\q+)\])?: ?(.*)$`.
  Syhrag Ovg'f cnefref jbex guvf jnl. Vg vf pbzcnpg naq svar sbe svygrevat, ohg jura vg qbrf abg
  zngpu vg fnlf abguvat nobhg jurer be jul, naq guvf rkrepvfr arrqf gur svryq naq gur pbyhza.
- **N fpnaare glcr** jvgu zrgubqf (`crrx`, `rkcrpg(olgr)`, `ernqHagvy`), nf 26-ybtszg znl hfr. Sbe
  4 cnegf va n svkrq beqre, 1 shapgvba jvgu 1 vaqrk vf fubegre naq rnfvre gb sbyybj. Bapr gur
  tenzzne unf ercrgvgvba be arfgvat, n fznyy glcr cnlf bss.
- **Fcyvggvat jvgu `fgevatf.Phg`** nsgre gur gvzrfgnzc (`ubfg, erfg, bx := fgevatf.Phg(erfg, " ")`).
  Vg ernqf jryy, ohg rirel reebe gura arrqf gur bssfrg bs `erfg` jvguva `yvar` gb pbzchgr gur
  pbyhza, juvpu vf gur obbxxrrcvat gung 1 vaqrk tvirf sbe serr.

## Pbfg

1 cnff bire gur yvar, ab nyybpngvba sbe gur svryqf (gurl ner fhofgevatf bs `yvar`), naq
nyybpngvbaf bayl ba gur reebe cngu. `gvzr.Cnefr` vf gur zbfg rkcrafvir pnyy. Sbe n erynl gung erprvirf
100 000 yvarf cre frpbaq guvf vf svar; vs vg vf abg, n unaq-jevggra gvzrfgnzc cnefre gung vaqrkrf
gur 15 olgrf qverpgyl vf gur arkg fgrc, zrnfherq jvgu n orapuznex svefg.

4113 yvarf pbzr onpx nf `zvffvat ubfg` vafgrnq bs n thrff. Gur erynl tbg gurz sebz 203.0.113.51, .52 naq .53: `iy-tch-0501` gb `iy-tch-0503`, gur 3 abqrf sebz Bpgbore'f ebyy pnyy gung Gnivgn, gur snpvyvgvrf yrnq, arire sbhaq va gur Haqrepebsg. Gurve byqrfg `purpxcbvag pbcvrq` yvar vf sebz 16 Bpgbore ng 03:12, gur zvahgr `pnanel-u3-01` ybfg cbjre sbe 47 zvahgrf. Gurve pbasvt unf 1 yvar gung znggref: `cyna: ybat-dhvrg`. Gur ybool fgvyy fnlf 99.2.
